            <title>[ZEPPELIN-2314] Watcher websocket connection origin null error</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-2314</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-2288&quot; title=&quot;Fix Cross-Site WebSocket check&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-2288&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-2288&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; brings websocket origin check which breaks some changes from &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1697&quot; title=&quot;ZeppelinHub storage layer websocket connection is broken&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-1697&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-1697&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; with the below logs&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ERROR &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;2017-03-24 18:44:48,184&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; (&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;Unknown macro: {qtp655381473-17}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt; NotebookWebSocketCreator.java&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;createWebSocket&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;:43) - Websocket request is not allowed by ZEPPELIN_ALLOWED_ORIGINS settings. Origin: null&lt;br/&gt;
 WARN &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;2017-03-24 18:44:48,191&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; (&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;Unknown macro: {WebSocketClient@334099170-86}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/div&gt;
