&lt;p&gt; ZeppelinClient.java&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;openWatcherSession&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;:198) - Couldn&apos;t establish websocket connection to Zeppelin &lt;br/&gt;
java.util.concurrent.ExecutionException: org.eclipse.jetty.websocket.api.UpgradeException: Didn&apos;t switch protocols&lt;br/&gt;
	at org.eclipse.jetty.util.FuturePromise.get(FuturePromise.java:123)&lt;br/&gt;
